        en: { name: 'Villa Cimbrone, Ravello', description: 'Villa gardens on a clifftop in Ravello, 350 metres above the sea. An avenue leads to the Terrace of Infinity, lined with marble busts, with views along the coast as far as Salerno.', tip: 'Arrive at opening time or near closing, when the terrace is almost empty; in summer Ravello hosts a music festival.' },
